Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Quantum conditional entropies in phase-shift keying protocols under passive \
attacks\
\>", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96623126185283*^9, 
  3.9662312664741416`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b75f8209-c41f-41b4-b876-\
3b50b08765e5"],

Cell["\<\
In this notebook we provide the details for the paper  G. Staffieri, G. \
Scala, C. Lupo, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Quantum conditional entropies in \
phase-shift keying protocols under passive attacks\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. \
The notebook is divided by 3 sections:\[LineSeparator]1. BPSK
2. QPSK solo entropie e rate non ottimizzati
3. QPSK con rate ottimizzati compilando\[NonBreakingSpace]in\
\[NonBreakingSpace]C\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9662312708022575`*^9, 
  3.9662313712472086`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8698a839-c662-4fcb-b2eb-\
6cafad65f530"],

